n conduits and infrastructure, and creating some sort of vessel, such as a train? Now, what if this Genius, who is a homosexual by the way, decides that he needs to educate his fellow dinosaurs with said train, and brings them to different parts of the dinosaur era to teach them about natural history and all that?<br /> <br /> Dinosaurs talk in this setting, it's a necessary caveat for this plot hook to work, especially since the Genius is also a talking dinosaur. I forgot to mention that. Moving on...<br /> <br /> Now, see, what if said train was used to travel through time to the future, where they discovered the after effects of an apocalyptic event which destroyed their dinosaur utopia. unable to ascertain at event was, let alone stop it, this Genius, with only a pair of precocious children (a pterodactyl and her adopted brother) for assistance, must now scour the time stream to find a way to save his people, either by stopping the event or ferrying them through time to a place where they will be safe to start anew...<br /> <br /> Let's just say.... <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><i>I ha</i></span><span style=\"color:#008000\"><i>v</i></span><span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><i>e a hy</i></span><span style=\"color:#008000\"><i>p</i></span><span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><i>ot</i></span><span style=\"color:#008000\"><i>h</i></span><span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><i>es</i></span><span style=\"color:#008000\"><i>i</i></span><span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><i>s.</i></span><br /> <img src=\"http://statici.behindthevoiceactors.com/behindthevoiceactors/_img/chars/mr-conductor-dinosaur-train-9.56.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/873174-dragon-rekindled-the-orobori-chronicles-embers-reboot#post873174\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:1